# Managed workflow scripts must stay LF in the working tree.
#
# These files are shipped to the OpenCode profile LF-normalized, and one of them
# is imported directly by the test suite. Under core.autocrlf they check out as
# CRLF, and a CRLF shebang line breaks Vite's module transform — the suite fails
# to load on any Windows checkout while passing on the author's machine, because
# freshly written files have not yet round-tripped through git.
src/main/opencode/managed-workflow/scripts/*.mjs text eol=lf
